:''For the [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] version of this stage, see [[Moon (Empire of Cats)/Outbreak|here]].''
'''Moon''' is the 48th and final stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. Each chapter introduces a different boss and reward unit. In Chapter 1, [[The Face]] makes his first appearance and unlocks [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]] when defeated; in Chapter 2, it's [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]; in Chapter 3, [[Teacher Bun Bun]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], clearing the Moon stage from Chapter 1 unlocks [[Higher Score|Challenge Mode]], additional [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] units, and the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] banner are unlocked. When clearing Iriomote in Chapter 2, the raw level cap is raised to level 20, [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] is unlocked, more Rare Cat Capsule units were added, and the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] banner was unlocked. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], clearing this stage unlocks the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] and [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] gacha banners and the ability to play the [[Heavenly Tower]].

